# Goga Stainless — EmailJS Configuration
# -------------------------------------------------------------
# Follow the checklist in CPANEL_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md or README.md:
# 1. Sign up / Log in to EmailJS: https://dashboard.emailjs.com/
# 2. Add an Email Service (e.g. Gmail) and copy your Service ID
# 3. Create an Email Template and copy your Template ID
# 4. Copy your Public Key from Account > API Keys
# -------------------------------------------------------------

# EmailJS Service ID (e.g., service_abc123)
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_emailjs_service_id

# EmailJS Template ID (e.g., template_xyz789)
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_emailjs_template_id

# EmailJS Public Key (e.g., user_xxxxxxxxxxxx or public_key_xxxx)
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_emailjs_public_key

# Recipient inbox for enquiries
VITE_RECIPIENT_EMAIL=info.gogastainless@gmail.com
